6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h</switch><else><reset-time 21 6><switch $weekday><case>dimanche<case>lundi<case>mardi<case>mercredi<case>jeudi<case>vendredi<case>samedi</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h</if> (temps réel).
